  "Question": "In \\(\\odot O\\), the inscribed angle subtended by chord \\(AB\\) is \\(\\angle ACB=90^\\circ\\). Which conclusion is correct?",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "\\(AB\\) is shorter than the radius of \\(\\odot O\\).",
    "B": "\\(AB\\) is a diameter of \\(\\odot O\\).",
